    "text": "By WCYB ,\n8 hours ago KINGSPORT, Tenn. (WCYB) — At least one pet is dead following a fire in Kingsport, according to officials. Kingsport Fire Department Community Risk Reduction Specialist & Public Information Officer Barry Brickey told News 5 that crews responded to the 2600 block of Watterson Street just before noon on Wednesday. Read full article",
